---
name: phase-3-outline
description: The outline phase sub-workflow of the plan unit.
type: subworkflow
icon: phase.outline
entry: start
entry: light
entry: rework
exit: done
exit: returned
exit: escalate_to_deep
modification_date: 2026-01-15
version: 0.1.0
author: plan-marshall
---
# The outline phase as its own unit, written for the invariant and unit-loader tests, never copied from the product.
# The deep lane passes outline.qgate before outline.gate. The light lane enters the light envelope outline.light, whose
# accepted outline passes the light gate outline.light-gate before outline.gate; the gate's deep outcome is the
# light -> deep ratchet, which leaves the phase on its `escalate_to_deep` exit for refine. The envelope's own judgment
# escalation is not modelled: its entity kind `change` of the tests evaluates `approved` alone.
# Only outline.gate enters Phase 4, through the `done` exit. Each lane routes its rework to its own authoring entry, no
# router reads the lane: the deep Q-Gate remediation re-enters outline.deep, a light rework re-enters outline.light
# through the entry `light`, so the deep route reaches no state of the light route. Every rework cycle passes a job,
# its awaited event. The plan unit re-enters the phase through `entry rework`.
workflow phase-3-outline version 1 format 1
scope subworkflow
entry start -> outline.deep
entry light -> outline.light
entry rework -> outline.rework-entry

state outline.deep
    job llm change role outline
        approved -> outline.qgate
        lost -> outline.return-exit

state outline.qgate
    auto test.qgate
        pass -> outline.gate
        blocking -> outline.remediate

state outline.remediate
    call remediation.qgate-findings(retry_budget = 2, fix_budget = 2, waiver_wait_seconds = 3600, actions = [retry, fix])
        resolved -> outline.gate
        waived -> outline.gate
        exhausted -> outline.return-exit
        fix_requested -> outline.deep
        stepped_out -> outline.return-exit

state outline.light
    job llm change role outline
        approved -> outline.light-gate
        lost -> outline.return-exit

state outline.light-gate
    auto test.gate
        pass -> outline.gate
        deep -> outline.escalate-exit

state outline.gate
    auto test.proceed
        done -> outline.done-exit

state outline.rework-entry
    auto test.proceed
        done -> outline.deep

state outline.done-exit terminal done success

state outline.return-exit terminal returned failure

state outline.escalate-exit terminal escalate_to_deep success
